      "value": "@{58c62e995865713647a7115b|full_name}: I thought about how useful it would be when I made my RC car. I have a remote with buttons and to go forward you \"on interact\" up, then to stop you need to \"on interact\" stop. \n\nif we have the triggers proposed we could hold a button to go forward then let go to stop. any type of action that you want to precisely control will benefit from this",
